        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Paulo na batūng'wa bataale",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho yabīta myaka ikūmi n'īne nūja ko hangī ī Yelusalemu, nalī na Balinaba hamò na Tito. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakaja ko kūlwa nguno nakakundūlīlwa ū mhayo gwenūyo, nūkibona nabo a batongeeji abo baalī bamanīkile. Nūhoya nabo balī boi dūhū. Nūboolekeja ī Ng'hūlū Jawiza ījo nakūjilomeelaga kū banhū ba mahanga, nguno naalī natatogilwe kūbiza hamo naatagambaga, nūūlū nakūtagambaga dalali dūhū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū Tito ūyo naalī nang'hwe atahadīkilwe ū kūsaalwa nūūlū īkī walī Nyunani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike būkabiza ho wihalalīja, nguno gashinaga baalī benhwa badūgū ba nyalomolomo mu wiba wiba, kwiza kūbūdata ū wiyabī wise, ūbo tūlī nabo mulī Kilisito Yesu, gīkī batwingīje mu būsese. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo tūtabazunīlīgije nūūlū hado ū kūtūyebenganya, īkī twalī tūtogilwe ī ng'hana ya Ng'hūlū Jawiza yikale ho kūlwa nguno ying'we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū abo bamanīkile gīkī bataale (ū nene natūlonja ūmo babizīle, nguno ū Mulungu atasolanhyaga banhū), abo bamanīkile gīkī bataale benabo, batanongelelegije mhayo gose gose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būgelela kūbona dūhū gīkī ū nene ninhwa Ng'hūlū Jawiza ja kūbatwalīla banhū ba mahanga, gīt'ūmo Petelo winhīlwa ja kūbatwalīla Bayudaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ūyo wang'winha ū Petelo nīmo kūlwa Bayudaya, hū ng'wene ūyo akaninha nū nene kūlwa banhū ba mahanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū a ba Yakobo nū Kefa nū Yohana, abo bamanīkile gīkī hū jene ī ng'hīngī, aho bawitegeleja ū būdūla ūbo ninhwa, būtwinha ū nene nū Balinaba nkono gwa būlyo kūlwa būsangī, gīkī a bise tūje ū kū mahanga, lelo a bene baje ū kū Bayudaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike dūhū būtūlomba tūyūbizūkwa a bahabī; na ng'hana ū nīmo gwenūyo tūkabiza na būkalalwa būtaale ū kūgwīta.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.2.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Paulo kūng'hūgūla Kefa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū Kefa akiza Antiokia, wahayūshika wīta mhayo ūyo gwalī gwigeleelilwe nsango; nūng'hūgūla hape hape kū būtongi bo banhū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno a h'ikanza lya shilīwa walyaga nabo a banhū ba mahanga, alīyo bahayiza banhū balebe ba kūfuma kūlī Yakobo, ūbogoha a Bayudaya wikomanya, wisunda ha mhūjo! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na Bayudaya bangī būtwalanījiwa nū wibeeleja bokwe; nose nū Balinaba ūjananījiwa ū mu wibeeleja wabo! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho nabona gīkī bafumīla hanze ya būtūngīlīja bo Ng'hūlū Jawiza, nūng'wīla ū Kefa kū būtongi wa bose; gīkī, “Ū bebe ūlū ūlī Nyudaya, alīyo ī nhūngwa jako jilī gītī ja banhū ba mahanga, jitī gītī ja Bayudaya, nibūlī ūlībahadīkīja a banhū ba mahanga kūlondeela nhūngwa ja Bayudaya?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.2.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Būpīji kūlwa kūzunya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bise abo tūlī Bayudaya mu shibyalīlwe, abo tūtī banhū ba mahanga, a ba shibi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "tūmanile gīkī ū munhū atīko kūbalīlwa būtūngīlīja kūlwa shītwa sha mu shilagīlo, ūlū ītī kūlwa kūnzunya Yesu Kilisito dūhū. H'ī nguno yene na a bise tūnzunije ū Kilisito Yesu, gīkī tūbalīlwe būtūngīlīja kūlwa kūnzunya Kilisito, ītī kūlwa shītwa sha mu shilagīlo. Nguno atīho nūūlū ūmò ūyo akūbalīlwa būtūngīlīja kūlwa shītwa sha mu shilagīlo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ūlū tūlī bakomeezu ba kūkooba kūbalīlwa būtūngīlīja kūlwa ng'wa Kilisito, hūna tūbiza tūlī ba shibi, angū, hū kūhaya gīkī ū Kilisito alī ntūmami wa kūgaliila shibi? Ūtī chene na hado yaya! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike ūlū nandya kwīzenga hangī īyo naamala kwīsambagūla, nakwiyoolecha gīkī nalī ng'hūbi ū nene! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.2.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū nene nachile ū kū shilagīlo; shanibūlaga shoi, gīkī nabize mpanga kūlī Mulungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.2.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakomilwe ha nsalaba hamò na Kilisito; hūna lūūlū ū nene ng'wenekīlī natī mpanga, alīyo Kilisito h'ūyo alī mpanga ū mulī nene. Hama ū būpanga ūbo nalī nabo ī haha ū mu mīlī gwane, nakūbūtūmamīlaga mu kūnsanya Ng'wana wa ng'wa Mulungu, ūyo akifunya wei ng'wenekīlī kūlwa nguno yane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.2.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 2:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nene natīko kūshisundīla ha mhūjo ī shigongo sha ng'wa Mulungu, nguno ū mhayo gwa kūbalīlwa būtūngīlīja ūlū gūbize gūlīho kūlwa shilagīlo, numho ū Kilisito akacha dalali!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.2.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
